#. translators: the ##...## tokens are merge placeholders substituted with real order data at send time - keep them verbatim.
#: app/Config/email-defaults/failed.php:4
#: app/Config/email-defaults/failed.php:28
msgid "##shop_name## – Payment Failed for Order ###order_id##"
msgstr "##shop_name## – Échec du paiement pour la commande ###order_id##"

#. translators: the ##...## tokens are merge placeholders substituted with real order data at send time - keep them verbatim.
#: app/Config/email-defaults/failed.php:6
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hi ##customer_name##,\n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately, we were unable to process the payment for your order ###order_id##. This may have happened due to one of the following reasons:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>The card was declined or had insufficient funds</li>\n"
"    <li>Incorrect card details or billing information</li>\n"
"    <li>The payment was not authorized or timed out</li>\n"
"    <li>A temporary issue with the payment provider</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"Order Summary:\n"
"##product_table##\n"
"Items in Order: ##number_of_items##\n"
"Total Amount: ##order_total##\n"
"\n"
"Your items are still saved. You can retry the payment or place a new order anytime at: ##checkout_page##\n"
"\n"
"Need help? Just reach out – we’re here to support you.\n"
""
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Bonjour ##customer_name##,\n"
"\n"
"Malheureusement, nous n’avons pas pu traiter le paiement de votre commande ###order_id##. Cela peut être dû à l’une des raisons suivantes :\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>La carte a été refusée ou le solde était insuffisant</li>\n"
"    <li>Les informations de carte ou de facturation sont incorrectes</li>\n"
"    <li>Le paiement n’a pas été autorisé ou a expiré</li>\n"
"    <li>Un problème temporaire chez le prestataire de paiement</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"Récapitulatif de la commande :\n"
"##product_table##\n"
"Articles dans la commande : ##number_of_items##\n"
"Montant total : ##order_total##\n"
"\n"
"Vos articles sont toujours enregistrés. Vous pouvez réessayer le paiement ou passer une nouvelle commande à tout moment sur : ##checkout_page##\n"
"\n"
"Besoin d’aide ? Contactez-nous – nous sommes là pour vous accompagner.\n"

#. translators: the ##...## tokens are merge placeholders substituted with real order data at send time - keep them verbatim.
#: app/Config/email-defaults/failed.php:30
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"Payment for order ###order_id## from ##customer_name## has failed. The failure may have occurred due to:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Card declined or insufficient funds</li>\n"
"    <li>Invalid card or billing details</li>\n"
"    <li>Unauthorized or timed-out payment</li>\n"
"    <li>A temporary payment gateway issue</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"Order Details:\n"
"##product_table##\n"
"Number of Items: ##number_of_items##\n"
"Total Amount: ##order_total##\n"
"\n"
"The customer may retry payment from: ##checkout_page##\n"
"Please follow up if needed.\n"
""
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Le paiement de la commande ###order_id## de ##customer_name## a échoué. Cet échec peut être dû à :\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Carte refusée ou solde insuffisant</li>\n"
"    <li>Informations de carte ou de facturation invalides</li>\n"
"    <li>Paiement non autorisé ou expiré</li>\n"
"    <li>Un problème temporaire de la passerelle de paiement</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"Détails de la commande :\n"
"##product_table##\n"
"Nombre d’articles : ##number_of_items##\n"
"Montant total : ##order_total##\n"
"\n"
"Le client peut réessayer le paiement depuis : ##checkout_page##\n"
"Merci d’assurer le suivi si nécessaire.\n"

#. translators: the ##...## tokens are merge placeholders substituted with real account data at send time - keep them verbatim.
#: app/Config/email-defaults/new_account.php:4
msgid "Welcome to ##shop_name## - You're All Set!"
msgstr "Bienvenue sur ##shop_name## - Tout est prêt !"

#. translators: the ##...## tokens are merge placeholders substituted with real account data at send time - keep them verbatim.
#: app/Config/email-defaults/new_account.php:6
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hi ##customer_name##,\n"
"\n"
"Welcome to ##shop_name##! We're so glad you're here. Your account is ready to go.\n"
"\n"
"With your account you can:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Track and manage your orders in one place</li>\n"
"    <li>Browse your full purchase history</li>\n"
"    <li>Download digital purchases anytime</li>\n"
"    <li>Check out quicker next time</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"One quick step - please set your password to secure your account:\n"
"##password_reset_link##\n"
"\n"
"Then you're ready to start shopping: ##shop_page##\n"
"\n"
"Thanks for joining us. We hope you find exactly what you're looking for!\n"
"\n"
"Warm regards,\n"
"The ##shop_name## Team\n"
""
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Bonjour ##customer_name##,\n"
"\n"
"Bienvenue sur ##shop_name## ! Nous sommes ravis de vous compter parmi nous. Votre compte est prêt à l’emploi.\n"
"\n"
"Avec votre compte, vous pouvez :\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Suivre et gérer vos commandes au même endroit</li>\n"
"    <li>Consulter l’intégralité de votre historique d’achats</li>\n"
"    <li>Télécharger vos achats numériques à tout moment</li>\n"
"    <li>Commander plus rapidement la prochaine fois</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"Une dernière étape - veuillez définir votre mot de passe pour sécuriser votre compte :\n"
"##password_reset_link##\n"
"\n"
"Vous serez ensuite prêt à faire vos achats : ##shop_page##\n"
"\n"
"Merci de nous avoir rejoints. Nous espérons que vous trouverez exactement ce que vous cherchez !\n"
"\n"
"Cordialement,\n"
"L’équipe ##shop_name##\n"

